[
    {
        "id": 0,
        "original": "今日はバイトに行く前に、少しだけ屋上に顔を出すことにした。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hari ini, sebelum berangkat kerja sambilan, aku memutuskan untuk mampir sebentar ke atap.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 1,
        "original": "昨日は平気とは言っていたけど、具体的にどう平気なのかどうしても気になるからな。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Meskipun kemarin dia bilang tidak apa-apa, aku tetap penasaran apa maksud sebenarnya dari kata 'tidak apa-apa' itu.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 2,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 3,
        "original": "「ちなみに叶方から見てどうなんだ？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ngomong-ngomong, menurut pandanganmu bagaimana, Kanata？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 4,
        "original": "叶方",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Kanata",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "original": "@t55@d1「白河の恋愛請負？普通にやってるなーってくらいだよ。むしろ今までより減少傾向にあるって雰囲気かな」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t55@d1「Biro jodoh Shirakawa？ Kelihatannya dia melakukannya seperti biasa sih. Malah rasanya jumlahnya cenderung berkurang dibanding sebelumnya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "original": "「減ってるのか、それはそれで意外だな」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Berkurang ya, itu agak mengejutkan」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "original": "叶方",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Kanata",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "original": "「ま、それでもたまーに未羽ちゃんに追っかけられてる姿は見るけどね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Yah, tapi aku sesekali masih melihat dia dikejar-kejar oleh Miu-chan kok」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "original": "「あぁ、なら安心だ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ah, kalau begitu aku lega」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "original": "その目撃談が皆無となった日には、あぁとうとう……としんみりした気分になるからな。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Karena jika kesaksian mata seperti itu sampai hilang sama sekali, aku pasti akan merasa sedih dan berpikir bahwa semuanya sudah berakhir.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "original": "杉並",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Suginami",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "original": "「安心するがいい、同志を不安にさせるようなことは決してしない。白河嬢もこれまで通り活動し、これまで通り追われる身となるだろう、それは俺が保証する」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Tenang saja, aku tidak akan pernah membiarkan kawan merasa cemas. Nona Shirakawa akan tetap beraksi seperti biasa, dan tetap akan menjadi buron seperti biasa, aku yang menjamin itu」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "original": "「お前が保証？どういうこったよ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Kamu yang menjamin? Apa maksudnya?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "original": "杉並",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Suginami",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "original": "@t60@d1「はーっはっはっはっは、知りたいか？ようやくと言っていいが、とある風紀委員を取り込むことに成功した」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t60@d1「Hahahaha! Kamu ingin tahu？ Akhirnya bisa kukatakan kalau aku berhasil merekrut seorang anggota komite kedisiplinan」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "original": "杉並",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Suginami",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "original": "@t27@d1「これで向こうの情報がつつがなく手に入ることになった、無論俺からも提供するがな」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t27@d1「Dengan ini, informasi dari pihak sana bisa didapatkan tanpa hambatan. Tentu saja, aku juga akan memberikan informasi dari pihakku」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "original": "「お前、ついにスパイを手に入れたのか……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Kamu... akhirnya punya mata-mata ya...」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "original": "杉並",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Suginami",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "original": "「この場合はシンパと言っていい。これでまた悲願に向けて近づいたわけだ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Dalam hal ini, sebut saja dia simpatisan. Dengan ini, langkah menuju impian kita sudah semakin dekat」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "original": "杉並",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Suginami",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "original": "「そういうことで、これからはより一層、白河嬢の動向が風紀委員に伝わることになる、安心するがいい」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Maka dari itu, mulai sekarang pergerakan Nona Shirakawa akan lebih sering dilaporkan ke komite kedisiplinan, jadi tenanglah」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "original": "「それ安心とは言わねえよ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Itu sih namanya gak bikin tenang!」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "original": "相談件数は減ってると言っても、白河の受難は当分続きそうだなぁ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Meskipun jumlah konsultasi berkurang, sepertinya penderitaan Shirakawa masih akan terus berlanjut untuk sementara waktu.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "original": "「……あれ？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「...Eh？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "original": "いつのもベンチには、白河の他にも、二乃やそら姉、そして有里栖の姿まで。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Di bangku yang biasa, selain Shirakawa, ada Nino, Sora-nee, dan bahkan Arisu juga.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "original": "「あ、兄さん遅いですよー」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ah, Nii-san telat ih-」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "original": "「みんなも来てたのか」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Kalian semua datang juga ternyata」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "original": "有里栖",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Arisu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "original": "「うん、最近来られてなかったから、ちょっと話聞いてみようかなーと思って」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Iya, soalnya akhir-akhir ini nggak sempat ke sini, jadi kupikir mau coba dengar ceritanya sebentar-」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "original": "考えることはみんな一緒ってか。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ternyata pikiran semuanya sama ya.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "original": "そうだよな、だって先月とかレジェパで滅茶苦茶忙しかったし。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Wajar sih, soalnya bulan lalu sibuk banget gara-gara Legend Party.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "original": "一気にやることが無くなったら、どうしてもそわそわしちゃうというか。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Begitu mendadak nggak ada yang dikerjain, rasanya jadi gelisah gimana gitu.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "original": "「それで白河、昨日はああ言ってたけど、本当に平気なのか？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Terus Shirakawa, kemarin kamu bilang begitu, tapi beneran nggak apa-apa？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "original": "@t29@d1「意外……というわけでもないけど、相談件数はかなり少ない方だね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t29@d1「Bukannya mengejutkan sih... tapi jumlah konsultasinya emang lumayan sedikit」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "original": "「ふぅん、卒業シーズンだから、もしかしたらひっきりなしに来てそうとは思ってたんだけどな」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Hmm, karena ini musim kelulusan, kupikir bakal ada yang datang terus-terusan」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "original": "諳子",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sorane",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "original": "「卒業って言っても、ほとんど形式だけだもんね。付属から本校に上がるだけで、通う校舎も変わらないし」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Biarpun dibilang kelulusan, itu cuma formalitas aja kan. Cuma naik dari sekolah menengah ke sekolah utama, gedung sekolahnya juga nggak ganti」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "original": "「あー言われてみれば」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ah, bener juga kalau dipikir-pikir」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "original": "実際この時期になっても、卒業って意識なんかまったくないもんな。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Kenyataannya biarpun sudah di masa seperti ini, aku sama sekali nggak sadar kalau sudah mau lulus.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "original": "あれをやり過ごした、ずっとこのままでいたい！",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Perasaan seperti sudah melewati hal itu, atau ingin terus seperti ini selamanya！",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "original": "そんな気持ちも皆無だ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Perasaan semacam itu pun nihil.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "original": "「手伝えることがないっていうのは、それはそれで寂しいな」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Nggak ada yang bisa dibantu itu rasanya kesepian juga ya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "original": "@t45@d1「ふっふっふ、そんな心配はご無用です。どうせ来月からは一気に忙しくなりますから」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t45@d1「Fufufu, nggak perlu khawatir soal itu. Toh mulai bulan depan bakal langsung sibuk banget」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "original": "有里栖",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Arisu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "original": "「新入生が来るもんね、ひよりんの噂って島外にまで届いてるし」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Karena murid baru bakal datang ya, apalagi rumor tentang Hiyorin kan sudah sampai ke luar pulau」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "original": "ひより",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hiyori",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "original": "@bt1@t15@d1「正解。もしかしたらまたレジェパを開催する必要も出てくるかもしれないよ？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@bt1@t15@d1「Tepat sekali. Mungkin saja nanti perlu mengadakan Legend Party lagi lho？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "original": "有里栖",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Arisu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "original": "「ええっ！？ちょ、脅さないでよひよりん！」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Eeeh！？ Tung-tunggu, jangan nakut-nakutin gitu dong, Hiyorin！」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "original": "「いや、案外マジになるかもな、それ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Nggak, tapi kayaknya itu bisa beneran terjadi sih」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "original": "叶方",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Kanata",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "original": "「うん、普通に無くは無いかもね、それ。だって新入生が多いってことは、それだけ有里栖ちゃんを初めて見る男子も多いわけだし」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Iya, mungkin saja itu bakal kejadian. Soalnya dengan banyaknya murid baru, berarti makin banyak juga cowok yang baru pertama kali melihat Arisu-chan」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "original": "有里栖",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Arisu",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "original": "@t29@d1@t29@by2「え、ええぇぇ～～～……。困ったなぁ、それ……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t29@d1@t29@by2「E-eeehhh... Aduh, gawat juga kalau begitu...」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "original": "「もう一度あの規模のイベントを興すのは、相当難しいぞ……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Bakal sulit banget buat ngadain acara sebesar itu lagi...」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
